<===> conflict/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@use "other1" as *;
@use "other2" as *;

a {b: meta.global-variable-exists(member)}

<===> conflict/other1.scss
$member: from other1;

<===> conflict/other2.scss
$member: from other2;

<===> conflict/error
Error: This variable is available from multiple global modules.
    ,
2   | @use "other1" as *;
    | ================== includes variable
3   | @use "other2" as *;
    | ================== includes variable
... |
5   | a {b: meta.global-variable-exists(member)}
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ variable use
    '
  input.scss 5:7  root stylesheet

